### Why does the authoritative inventory check happen at checkout?

Stock can sell out between adding to the cart and checking out. The inventory check when adding to the cart is advisory only. The authoritative check and decrement happen at checkout under a lock or atomic operation.

```java
// Product.decrementStock is synchronized
